                                "sense_id": "73c15ed7-512a-3d02-9837-cd9a1bf8b30e",
                                "text": "Let the skie raine Potatoes: let it thunder, to the tune of Greene-ſleeues, haile-kiſſing Comfits, and ſnovv Eringoes: […]"
